Ladybird constrains sticky movement to the enclosing block instead of an
anonymous flow wrapper. Structural fieldset content boxes remain bounds.

Blink’s LayoutBoxModelObject::ComputeStickyPositionConstraints skips
anonymous containing blocks, except for the fieldset content box.

WebKit’s RenderBoxModelObject::computeStickyPositionConstraints skips
anonymous blocks when selecting the bounds for sticky movement.

Gecko’s StickyScrollContainer::ComputeStickyLimits uses nsIFrame::
GetContainingBlock(). Its IsBlockContainer() excludes the wrappers
around blocks inside inline elements.
